### 8. Security checks

{{builder_tool}} confirms each of these and reports how it checked.

- [ ] Access is enforced on the server for every new endpoint or action.
- [ ] No secrets, sensitive content, or personal identifiers in code, logs, or error messages.
- [ ] Inputs are validated on the server.
- [ ] New audit events are written for the actions in this milestone (if the spec requires an audit trail).
